      "content" : "6.5.   As explained above, the owner(s) of each of the Relevant Documents were asked to prepare drafting for code change proposals that would meet our drafting instructions. In each case the changes proposed for offshore transmission are marked against baseline text for the Relevant Document that was current when the drafting was prepared.",
